  dc:modified "2024-08-01"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "Flags that represent sexual identities, gender identities, and romantic orientations that fall under the LGBTQ+ umbrella, as well as flags representing LGBTQ+ subcultures and communities."@en;
