  dc:modified "2024-08-01"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "Two Spirit youth between the ages of 12-18 who have experienced and survived bullying due to their gender or sexual identity; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible."@en;
