  dc:modified "2025-01-26"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "The particular impact of the COVID-19 pandemic on LGBTQ+ people and communities, including changes in access to health care, intimate relationship dynamics and safer sex practices, financial stability, social connectedness, and mental health."@en;
